{"id": null, "n": "0084001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0084001", "type": "orig", "text": "梵字真言附載於卷末 cf. P. 89b"}
{"id": null, "n": "0089001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0089001", "type": "orig", "text": "此梵字真言依靈雲寺板普通真言藏載之 cf. P. 84a"}
